Z||000013||starfighter007@msn.com||09-06-2001||11:47 AM||||I would leave the brick alone if you ever go to sell the house that can be a real turn off to a lot of potential buyers. before I would ever do any thing that drastic to my house.I ask my self things like does aynbody ever ask their reality agent I would like to see a house that the previous owner painted the bricks on the house I would definetly consult with a realestate agent in your area and get their opinion on this matter just my .02||||reg||7
